window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Four inexplicable supernatural bonds. One rogue monster on a rampage. What's a girl made of sunshine to do?</b><br> <br> For once in my life, everything was going perfectly. I'd finally confronted the man who'd caged me, my teammates and I were seeing eye to eye, and a couple of those friendships were coming with some very delicious benefits.<br> <br> So of course my powers had to find another way to surprise me.<br> <br> I've accidentally marked all four of my distractingly handsome teammates with my glow... and these new bonds seem to have declared no take-backs. My happiness has left the men I've been falling for very unhappy.<br> <br> With more strange monsters stalking the countryside, one of them determined to bash up an entire city, our personal problems need to take the backseat. But can we still work as a team if no one's willing to play for keeps?</p> <p>*<i>Bizarre Bonds</i> is the second book in a new urban fantasy trilogy from bestselling author Eva Chase. If you love a sunshine-y heroine, hot dangerous monsters who'll soften only for her, and plenty of laughs, action, and steam, dive right in!*</p>"; 
